WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.320 --> 00:03.560
Xu Feiyu.

3
00:06.320 --> 00:08.760
Xu Feiyu!

4
00:10.520 --> 00:11.640
Xu Feiyu!

5
00:13.320 --> 00:15.000
Xu Feiyu!

6
00:15.320 --> 00:16.680
Where did you go, Xu Feiyu!

7
00:18.080 --> 00:19.560
Xu Feiyu!

8
00:59.520 --> 01:01.120
Stop looking.

9
01:01.720 --> 01:02.920
He hasn't been back here.

10
01:07.280 --> 01:09.519
Were you seeing things just now?

11
01:09.520 --> 01:11.520
Charging out like a lunatic.

12
01:13.600 --> 01:14.880
Sorry.

13
01:15.400 --> 01:17.400
Just now I kind of lost it.

14
01:20.680 --> 01:22.480
Your head's full of Xu Feiyu, huh?

15
01:23.120 --> 01:24.880
Don't tease me.

16
01:25.600 --> 01:26.600
Oh right.

17
01:26.760 --> 01:27.760
Is dinner ready?

18
01:28.720 --> 01:30.240
What dinner?

19
01:30.800 --> 01:32.039
You came here

20
01:32.040 --> 01:33.120
to cook, didn't you?

21
01:34.400 --> 01:37.119
I only came by to check on things

22
01:37.120 --> 01:39.400
so you don't burn down Mr. Song's studio too.

23
01:45.720 --> 01:47.040
Senior.

24
01:47.440 --> 01:48.440
I'm hungry.

25
01:53.680 --> 01:57.200
Every one of you gives me a head ache.

26
02:00.120 --> 02:01.520
I'll make you noodles!

27
02:02.120 --> 02:03.120
Yes!

28
02:03.160 --> 02:04.160
Thanks, Senior.

29
02:07.520 --> 02:08.520
Song Yi.

30
02:09.320 --> 02:09.880
Hm?

31
02:10.040 --> 02:11.760
Don't tell me you're living here?

32
02:12.720 --> 02:13.720
Don't worry.

33
02:13.800 --> 02:14.800
I'm not staying here.

34
02:17.280 --> 02:18.760
I've got a better place.

35
03:20.920 --> 03:21.920
Thank you.

36
04:14.880 --> 04:15.880
Hey.

37
04:16.120 --> 04:17.520
There he is, the great author.

38
04:18.320 --> 04:19.160
Ah.

39
04:19.161 --> 04:20.200
Comic artist, I mean.

40
04:20.480 --> 04:21.280
The usual.

41
04:21.280 --> 04:22.280
Here.

42
04:22.880 --> 04:23.880
Thanks.

43
04:39.320 --> 04:40.440
Are you here alone?

44
04:48.600 --> 04:50.400
I think I've seen you in my elevator.

45
04:51.240 --> 04:52.240
Did you just move in?

46
04:55.480 --> 04:56.480
Mm.

47
04:57.840 --> 04:59.200
This bar isn't close by.

48
04:59.680 --> 05:01.240
Why come so far just to drink?

49
05:06.240 --> 05:07.960
Why have you not said a word?

50
05:08.560 --> 05:09.160
Perhaps

51
05:09.320 --> 05:10.320
you cannot speak?

52
05:12.920 --> 05:14.400
Then let's have a drink.

53
05:25.440 --> 05:27.519
Since you do not care for conversation

54
05:27.520 --> 05:28.760
then let's just drink.

55
05:37.440 --> 05:39.359
Do you know why I always come this far

56
05:39.360 --> 05:40.360
to get to this bar?

57
05:44.760 --> 05:45.320
As I recall

58
05:45.321 --> 05:47.480
the first time I came to this bar

59
05:47.760 --> 05:48.880
was nine months ago.

60
05:50.520 --> 05:53.126
I'm embarrassed to say someone brought me here.

61
05:55.440 --> 05:57.440
At the time I had just had eye surgery

62
05:57.920 --> 05:58.920
wrapped in bandages

63
05:59.280 --> 06:00.480
I couldn't see a thing.

64
06:01.680 --> 06:02.680
So

65
06:02.720 --> 06:04.560
I had no idea which bar it was.

66
06:08.160 --> 06:09.960
Are you curious how I found it?

67
06:10.680 --> 06:11.680
Mm.

68
06:12.840 --> 06:14.280
Then let's have a drink first.

69
06:17.920 --> 06:18.920
Bottoms up.

70
06:29.280 --> 06:30.400
Actually

71
06:30.880 --> 06:31.920
it was very simple.

72
06:33.320 --> 06:35.440
The person who brought me was dancing

73
06:36.480 --> 06:38.160
and there were lots of young women.

74
06:38.640 --> 06:39.640
Around here

75
06:40.200 --> 06:42.080
this is the only bar people can dance at.

76
06:46.080 --> 06:46.640
Excuse me.

77
06:46.960 --> 06:47.960
Coming.

78
06:48.200 --> 06:49.800
Bring the bottle I left last time.

79
06:50.080 --> 06:51.080
Yes.

80
06:53.680 --> 06:54.040
Well

81
06:54.560 --> 06:56.000
you might not like talking

82
06:56.480 --> 06:57.520
but surely you drink.

83
06:57.920 --> 06:58.920
Here you are.

84
06:59.720 --> 07:00.720
Thank you.

85
07:08.880 --> 07:10.120
To be honest

86
07:11.440 --> 07:13.080
you remind me of someone.

87
07:18.240 --> 07:19.960
But it is only a resemblance.

88
07:31.040 --> 07:32.920
A resemblance is all it can ever be.

89
07:34.040 --> 07:35.040
Because

90
07:36.800 --> 07:38.400
he is never coming back.

91
07:42.640 --> 07:43.800
Don't misunderstand me.

92
07:44.160 --> 07:45.400
He left this place.

93
07:46.320 --> 07:47.320
He was

94
07:49.160 --> 07:50.320
like a phantom.

95
08:05.280 --> 08:06.280
I suppose

96
08:08.880 --> 08:10.080
he will not be coming back.

97
08:18.640 --> 08:20.760
How embarrassing. I apologize.

98
08:22.480 --> 08:24.720
I don't know why I am telling you all this.

99
08:25.480 --> 08:26.480
Maybe

100
08:28.320 --> 08:29.960
you just remind me of him.

101
11:25.880 --> 11:27.400
Song Yi...

102
11:37.840 --> 11:39.160
Song... Yi.

103
11:41.240 --> 11:42.360
Song... Yi.

104
11:46.280 --> 11:47.400
Song... Yi.

105
11:50.400 --> 11:51.480
Song... Yi.

106
12:20.760 --> 12:21.760
Xu Feiyu.

107
12:23.080 --> 12:24.360
I'm back,

108
12:24.760 --> 12:25.960
I came back long ago.

109
12:27.600 --> 12:29.040
But the promise I made to your mom,

110
12:29.800 --> 12:30.920
like a thorn,

111
12:32.120 --> 12:33.520
pricks me every time I remember.

112
12:34.473 --> 12:36.200
I never knew how to bring it up.

113
12:37.800 --> 12:39.120
Actually, your aunt was the same—

114
12:39.160 --> 12:41.120
she knew the life and joy she wanted.

115
12:41.800 --> 12:43.120
That's why she took the leap—

116
12:44.560 --> 12:46.160
to seek it out and fight for it.

117
12:47.280 --> 12:48.880
Time can make us forget everything.

118
12:50.560 --> 12:52.080
But it can hold on to everything, too.

119
14:13.920 --> 14:15.000
You?

120
14:15.520 --> 14:16.560
You're up.

121
14:22.320 --> 14:23.320
Hm?

122
14:28.120 --> 14:29.120
Song Yi.

123
14:31.080 --> 14:31.600
What's wrong?

124
14:31.880 --> 14:32.880
Go on, eat.

125
14:34.320 --> 14:35.800
He's Song Yi.

126
14:35.840 --> 14:36.840
Oh.

127
14:43.040 --> 14:44.040
You got drunk last night

128
14:44.360 --> 14:45.360
after I got you home

129
14:45.400 --> 14:46.720
the drinks hit me too

130
14:46.920 --> 14:48.440
so I passed out on the couch.

131
14:51.320 --> 14:52.600
So you...

132
14:53.360 --> 14:54.360
Oh.

133
14:54.480 --> 14:55.480
Breakfast, right

134
14:55.720 --> 14:56.480
I woke up early

135
14:56.640 --> 14:57.240
so

136
14:57.240 --> 14:58.240
I just made some.

137
15:00.120 --> 15:01.960
I remember last night

138
15:02.720 --> 15:03.920
you didn't say a word.

139
15:04.480 --> 15:05.520
I thought you were...

140
15:06.880 --> 15:07.880
Here

141
15:08.200 --> 15:09.200
let's eat breakfast.

142
15:12.240 --> 15:13.240
Mm.

143
15:20.440 --> 15:21.440
Eat up
